[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13323.67, "timestamp": "03:42:03", "text": "服务器再等一天吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13326.71, "timestamp": "03:42:06", "text": "最后，当我完成的时候，是的，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13329.03, "timestamp": "03:42:09", "text": "公开服务器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13331.51, "timestamp": "03:42:11", "text": "她把它公开并放到了服务器上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13333.91, "timestamp": "03:42:13", "text": "她简介里有链接之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13338.71, "timestamp": "03:42:18", "text": "推广之后，很多人加入了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13341.32, "timestamp": "03:42:21", "text": "从那时起。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13342.55, "timestamp": "03:42:22", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13346.309, "timestamp": "03:42:26", "text": "你应该聘请一位服务经理。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13349.429, "timestamp": "03:42:29", "text": "这是痛苦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13359.11, "timestamp": "03:42:39", "text": "我的意思是，呃，我的意思是，有个经理是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13363.19, "timestamp": "03:42:43", "text": "就像你得付钱给那个人一样，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13366.79, "timestamp": "03:42:46", "text": "那个人正在投入时间去做这件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13374.76, "timestamp": "03:42:54", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13377.11, "timestamp": "03:42:57", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13379.83, "timestamp": "03:42:59", "text": "是的，"}]